{
 "_about": "Lobby idles 1 (2026-10-23, srp-026g/docs/notes/lobby-idles.md). A player's report: in the lobby the character sometimes freezes in one pose after a slight twitch. The lobby character plays a random clip of its weapon's user_animations_in_place/preview (player_logic_preview_state, exe 0x296D00; read from the weapon's own config by weapon_cook 0x24AA78), each blended in over 0.3 s. Two of the nine clips every rifle-held list names, ak/.../on_site/idle_wpn_loby (13.3 s) and idle_wpn_loby_3 (15 s), are a still pose: every channel of their 70 bones is a constant (5 knots), so the character blends into a pose and stands rigid for 13-15 s, 28 s when both come one after the other. Both go from the list of every weapon that names them (77 configs: the rifles, the shotguns, the SMGs and the TOZ-66); 9 -> 7 clips, the 7 left all move. The pistols' and the PKP's lists have no still clip. The clips stay in the archive.",
